                  },
                  "text": "func hasRPCSucceeded() bool {\n\treturn atomic.LoadUint32(\u0026rpcSucceeded) \u003e 0\n}",
                  "token_estimate": 19
                },
                {
                  "citation": {
                    "file": "examples/features/wait_for_ready/README.md",
                    "start_line": 1,
